index 000000000..589362b7e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/5631.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fix a ``ValueError`` during test collection when a test is decorated with
+``unittest.mock.patch(..., new=...)`` and ``new`` is an object whose equality
+result cannot be converted to a boolean, such as a NumPy array.
